                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "This patch compares the ConnectedCables list from config and wait for all cables to get discovered before starting CableMonitor. I don't think this is the right change because if some cable is actually missing we will never start the cable monitor.\n\n\n@amithash@meta.com I see you approved the change for SantaBarbara while i was on leave https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/openbmc/+/87249. Can you check my comment above ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/wait-cable-inventory",
                    "line": 23,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SueWang13",
                        "email": "Sue.Wang@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "SueWang13"
                    },
                    "message": "Because a timeout is configured, cable monitor will continue running even if some cables are not connected."
                }
